      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 584,
        "height": 504,
        "content": "## 📬 AI Inbox Concierge — Smart Email Triage & Auto-Draft OS\n\nEvery new email is classified by AI, a reply draft is written into the thread, everything is logged, and urgent items ping you instantly. Works for any business with an inbox.\n\n**Flow:** New email → Extract → AI Triage → Shape → log + draft reply + urgency routing.\n\n### Setup\n1. Connect **Gmail** (trigger, draft, alert) + **Anthropic** credentials.\n2. Set your alert inbox on the \"Send Urgent Alert\" node.\n3. Activate — the data table `email_triage_log` is already created."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
